# NOTE: Reference/ (the licensed Pofo template) lives OUTSIDE this repo, one
# level up in the workspace folder. It is unreachable from here by design —
# there is no ignore rule to accidentally break, and no way for `git add -f`
# to pull it in. Do not copy it into the repo.

# OS / editor cruft
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

# Node (only if we ever add tooling)
node_modules/

# Unoptimised source art — export web-ready files into assets/img/ instead.
*.psd
*.ai
*.tif
*.tiff
*_original.*

# Encoded, but shelved until the page that uses it exists (2026-08-27).
#
# These are NOT junk — they are finished encodes waiting on their piece pages,
# and their masters are in MediaPool. They stay out of history because a
# committed blob is permanent: once in, deleting the file later does not shrink
# a clone. Delete the matching rule when the page lands, then commit them.
#
# Docked — brief exists at Reference/DetailPages/Docked/Docked.md, no page yet.
assets/video/docked/
